WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.140
Jakarta. A sprawling capital where the heat is humid all year round.

2
00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:11.370
By 2040, half of Southeast Asia’s air conditioners could be in Indonesia.

3
00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:17.110
In 2025, health facilities were told to prepare for heat illness.

4
00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:21.610
Shade and cool roofs can keep that boom smaller.
